{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968100/extras/4a916022616741b225745df741a0fa7b.avif?t=1773322570\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968100/extras/8d55de1bd1627ae0f4eac4f1b4b4485a.avif?t=1773322570\" width=600 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CD-ROM is a game features series of puzzles located inside 10 different themed CDs. Players progress by deciphering coded texts, analyzing images, finding hints from mini-games and many more! Each clue leads players to 8 digit password they require to unlock next CD.\u00a010 CDs, 10 passwords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CD-ROM is a game highly related with cryptography and steganography. Many messages are hid inside various data for players to explore. Use programs inside your CDs to overcome these challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968100/extras/96d6db001c1022da2abd4b5921374168.avif?t=1773322570\" width=600 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers complex but fun puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968100?t=1773322570","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_